OL,3,AMeghan broke contact with father in
OL,4,Aletter citing abuse claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been reported that images of
OL,7,Fchild sexual abuse allegedly belonging
OL,8,Fto Markle had been found in his former
OL,9,Fhome in the Philippines and UK police
OL,10,Fin 2019 told Meghan about claims of
OL,11,Fabuse against him. Markle, who is based
OL,12,Fin the US, denies all such allegations.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
