OL,3,AIsrael to close West Bank crossings on
OL,4,Aelection day as crackdown escalates
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll West Bank land crossings will be
OL,7,Fclosed during Tuesday's election in
OL,8,FIsrael, the country's military says,
OL,9,Fand Palestinian workers will be barred
OL,10,Ffrom entering all settlements.
OL,12,FThe restrictions come amid a crackdown
OL,13,Fin the occupied West Bank after
OL,14,FPalestinian gunmen killed two Israeli
OL,15,Fsoldiers in the territory.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
